<title>UK: BFI down one at 1,290.</title>
<headline>BFI down one at 1,290.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Baltic Freight Index for spot dry cargo shipping rates was down one point today at 1,290, with the base being Jan 4 1985 equals 1,000. The BFI is based on the following sub-indices with rates in dollars</p>
